        "responsibility": "Loss-preserving shader contract and source-graph lifecycle, including schema, stage metadata parsing, immutable source-graph contracts, and root/VFS contract loading and projection; concrete VFS/resource resolution, preparation, frontend compilation, MaterialProgram production, and GPU execution are excluded."
      },
      "ShaderFrontend": {
